flowchart TB
  A[Points to RecordBatch] --> B{Estimated cache capacity available?}
  B -->|yes| C[Append batch and update counter]
  B -->|no| R[HTTP 503]
  C --> ACK[HTTP 200: added to cache]
  T[Timer] --> F[DataCache flush]
  N[80 percent Notify] --> F
  M[POST /flush] --> F
  F --> P[ParquetWriter]
